- `tests/Functional/Security/PasswordPolicyTest.php` (+2 tests): empty-config 7-char password rejected at `/register` (AC1/AC3); 73-byte password rejected (AC2). Both reuse the existing cleanup.

Verified the floor of 8 is safe against the suite — the shortest password in any success-expecting test is `userpass` (8 bytes); only failure tests use shorter ones, and admin-user-create uses its own separate min-6 check.

